    rdf:value """Thursday, Sept. 10, 1908
S.S. Marquette.
Grace with Mary and Harold, I with Ray and Karin and Ellie Rendel
Reached Antwerp two hours late and had an  awful  struggle to get the trunks over in time. In fact, the steamer waited awhile for them. We started at 12.10."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 276 ;
